"The Artonans brought the System to Earth in the early 1960s, about 70 years ago."
"The first superhumans were made when the System arrived."
"Without the Artonans, Earth might not have the internet or cell phones."
"For first contact the Artonans camped in the Ténéré in the Sahara."
"They invited world leaders to teleport in for wevvi and a talk about their species' future."
"Artonan children still ask whether humans come from Anesidora Earth or Sahara Earth."
"At first contact wizards and Avowed from almost every resource world appeared in the Sahara."
"They met the U.S. and Soviet leadership there."
"The wizard Tan-wyk stopped a volcanic eruption in Bali and stayed a year repairing villages."
"Museums worldwide have magic rooms reliving moments of first contact."
"The Artonans eradicated malaria for Earth."
"Their first definition of magic: how wizards prove their existence and assert dominion."
"That definition promised tools, healing and power to a few, and fueled fears of domination."
"The documentary The End of the Lonely Earth is famous and memorized in school."
